OL,3,GNEWSAStorks released in Cornwall
OL,4,Arewilding plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 21 white storks have been
OL,7,Freleased into the wild as part of a
OL,8,Fcharity's aim to reintroduce them in
OL,9,Fthe county.
OL,11,FYan Swiderski, founder of the Cornwall
OL,12,FStork Project, released the storks from
OL,13,Fthe project's base at Hamatethy, St
OL,14,FBreward, near Wadebridge last week.
OL,16,FIt is hoped the birds will eventually
OL,17,Freturn to their roots when they are
OL,18,Fready to breed, going on to raise their
OL,19,Fyoung in Cornwall and recolonising the
OL,20,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
