OL,3,GNEWSAStorks released in Cornwall
OL,4,Arewilding plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FSwiderski said the species "get
OL,7,Fimprinted on the place they first fly
OL,8,Ffrom" meaning they will "return from
OL,9,Ftheir migration and go back to almost
OL,10,Fexactly the same place they came from"
OL,11,Fwhen they decide it is time to nest.
